{%- comment -%}
  horizon-blocks Phase 10 — `product-title` block.

  Port of stock Horizon v4.1.1 (68760d9) blocks/product-title.liquid; schema
  t: strings hardcoded to Horizon's English. Deviations:
  - 'placeholders.product_title' | t hardcoded ("Product title").
  - The type_preset `info` key is dropped — it links to per-preset theme
    settings that don't exist in Dawn (presets are hardcoded at stock Horizon
    defaults in snippets/hz-type-variables.liquid; text-block precedent).
  - Custom-preset Font select trimmed 4 -> 2 options (Phase-1b text-block
    precedent: Dawn has 2 real font settings; subheading/accent values in
    hand-written JSON still resolve via hz-type-variables aliases).
  - The appended stylesheet extracts the two Horizon base.css utility classes
    this block's link markup depends on (.contents base.css:503-505,
    .user-select-text base.css:583-585) — Dawn ships neither. card-gallery
    carries its own .contents copy; the duplicate is deliberate so each
    file survives CSS subsetting independently.
  Renders the Phase-1b text snippet (fallback_text contract verified).
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if closest.product == blank %}
    {% assign product_title = '<p role="heading" aria-level="3">Product title</p>' %}
  {% render 'text', fallback_text: product_title, block: block %}
{% else %}
  {% assign product_title = '<p role="heading" aria-level="3">' | append: closest.product.title | append: '</p>' %}
  <a
    class="contents user-select-text"
    ref="productTitleLink"
    href="{{ closest.product.selected_or_first_available_variant.url }}"
  >
    {% render 'text', fallback_text: product_title, block: block %}
  </a>
{% endif %}

